{"name": "Whispers of Elenrod", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"51\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/042d286986863938caaca83ef3319ea9.webp?t=1784742275\" width=\"760\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/686e54b0f66eac166fbf5b02e54f7164.poster.avif?t=1784742275\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/686e54b0f66eac166fbf5b02e54f7164.webm?t=1784742275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/686e54b0f66eac166fbf5b02e54f7164.mp4?t=1784742275\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore procedurally generated maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a starting biome area and reveal fog of war to discover countless objects and treasures. Be sure to plan your path through Elenrod wisely, collecting only what fits your build, and save your strengths for the biome guards and final bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/c24aadd7dd9ad50846ad973949fca3f1.avif?t=1784742275\" width=\"760\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/5673c55aa256c14c2a8453a3ec2cc33a.poster.avif?t=1784742275\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/5673c55aa256c14c2a8453a3ec2cc33a.webm?t=1784742275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/5673c55aa256c14c2a8453a3ec2cc33a.mp4?t=1784742275\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defeat enemies </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To gather treasures, you need to defeat enemies in turn-based combat using battle cards.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/c24aadd7dd9ad50846ad973949fca3f1.avif?t=1784742275\" width=\"760\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/3a0fa2b47d95ba9279da1e4ee041152c.poster.avif?t=1784742275\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/3a0fa2b47d95ba9279da1e4ee041152c.webm?t=1784742275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/3a0fa2b47d95ba9279da1e4ee041152c.mp4?t=1784742275\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft a unique deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cards duing your journey through Elenrod. Enhance them with powerful runes. Choose cards that fit your build and use their combined power to do maximum damage with punishing combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/c24aadd7dd9ad50846ad973949fca3f1.avif?t=1784742275\" width=\"760\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/f9cea337fa81ad262c492dd80373b044.poster.avif?t=1784742275\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/f9cea337fa81ad262c492dd80373b044.webm?t=1784742275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/f9cea337fa81ad262c492dd80373b044.mp4?t=1784742275\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Evolve your character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beef up your card deck and exploration tool by selecting the right character skills. Gain experience defeating enemies, finding treasures, and completing quests. Discover mysterious relics and take their power to the next level by completing a given set of artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"142\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/extras/ecfc3fdbf1182ad0cd7120780b846f97.avif?t=1784742275\" width=\"760\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Deck-building meets strategy map exploration. Craft powerful decks. Discover mysterious artifacts on procedurally generated maps. Defeat enemies in turn-based combat and gain experience to evolve your hero. Create your best build\u2026and find all the Whispers of Elenrod!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774190/526933239b23f58122faecba187b277069d0823e/header.jpg?t=1784742275", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Game", "Turn-Based Combat", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "RPG", "Difficult", "Procedural Generation"], "developers": "Quick Turn Games", "publishers": "Quick Turn Games", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3774190", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "8 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/mX-ltFVv1x0", "first_seen": 1778191200.0, "review_rank": 657}